    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks for explaining that. it's a pretty intense sound though, almost sounds like it's alive or something when you're standing right next to the engine. is there any way to dampen that noise without losing the efficiency of the boost, or is that sound just an unavoidable part of how the air moves through the housing?",
